teries, bodacious puzzles, and tubular terrors. Build makeshift defenses like s\u2019mores snares, camera traps, and firefly decoys against the sinister presence that lurks within the trees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2775670/extras/708416e46e2e3b0c76acbd581e6eb0b0.poster.avif?t=1745357218\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2775670/extras/708416e46e2e3b0c76acbd581e6eb0b0.webm?t=1745357218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2775670/extras/708416e46e2e3b0c76acbd581e6eb0b0.mp4?t=1745357218\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect the pieces of the story to what is really happening, and make sure to be back in your bunk before curfew! Three days till Mom comes to pick you up. Can you go that long without croaking?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2775670/extras/3212db93c86e7ce05e9f80029794e103.poster.avif?t=1745357218\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2775670/extras/3212db93c86e7ce05e9f80029794e103.webm?t=1745357218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2775670/extras/3212db93c86e7ce05e9f80029794e103.mp4?t=1745357218\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Toadally Dreadful is a throwback 90\u2019s mascot horror. Hop into action when you realize your fellow campers have gone missing! Lake Oakwood holds radical mysteries, bodacious puzzles, and tubular terrors! Let\u2019s hope we can escape from the freaky frog frights or this campout will be TOADALLY DREADFUL!",
